+/* IOKit ABI v1: selector 0 -> four scalars [ABI, max_w, max_h, mapped_bytes].
+ * Selector 1: [width,height,pitch] -> [fence, hardware_elapsed_ns].
+ * Memory type 1 source, 2 destination; fixed client-local buffer handles.
+ * Admin only for bring-up. The API never returns DMA addresses. */
